@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:3000
@demoShipmentId = 11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111
@demoFilledContainerId = 22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222221
@demoEmptyContainerId = 22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222

### 01 - Consultar fixture precargado (esperado: 200; dos contenedores y dos documentos)
GET {{baseUrl}}/shipments/{{demoShipmentId}}

### 02 - Listar y encontrar el fixture por estado (esperado: 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/shipments?status=CREATED&limit=20&size=1

### 03 - Agregar ítem al contenedor vacío del fixture (esperado: 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/shipments/{{demoShipmentId}}/containers/{{demoEmptyContainerId}}/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Item agregado desde REST Client",
  "quantity": 3
}

### 04 - Verificar fixture después del agregado (esperado: 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/shipments/{{demoShipmentId}}
